     },
     "style": {
      "fontSize": 12,
      "color": "#334155",
      "lineHeight": 1.55
     },
     "content": "Seven days, six islands and not a single traffic light. Our route follows the Yasawa chain north from Nadi, trading resort comforts for village stays, snorkelling over living reef and evenings of string-band music.\n\nPack light, bring reef-safe sunscreen and leave room in your bag for the handwoven gifts you will not be able to resist.",
